/T (The existing mild-steel gas distribution network was removed and replaced with new 316-grade stainless-steel pipework featuring pressed joints, isolation valves, and robust Big Foot support systems. All pipework was strength tested, purged, and tightness tested to IGEM UP 1 and 2 standards to ensure full compliance and long-term safety.)
/E (The existing mild-steel gas distribution network was removed and replaced with new 316-grade stainless-steel pipework featuring pressed joints, isolation valves, and robust Big Foot support systems. All pipework was strength tested, purged, and tightness tested to IGEM UP 1 and 2 standards to ensure full compliance and long-term safety.)
